        "content": "## Pack capacity proxy\nProxy = `EnergyRemaining` Wh ÷ (Soc ÷ 100) sampled while parked (`Gear=P`). This is a **proxy with sample count**, never a bare health percent. Aging slopes with CI live in the Science Lab; here are the raw inputs."
